			"authority": "勞動基準法第24條第1項 — extended work is paid at no less than 4/3 of the ordinary hourly wage for the first two hours and 5/3 beyond, in force in this form since 2018-03-01; 第32條第2項 caps normal plus extended work at 12 hours a day, extended work at 46 hours a month and, where a union or a labour-management conference consents, at 138 hours in any three months; 第35條 gives 30 minutes' rest after four continuous hours; 第36條 gives two days' rest in every seven, one of them the 例假 that may not be worked; 第37條 and 紀念日及節日實施條例第8條 move a holiday that falls on a rest day to a 補假 rather than absorbing it; 第39條 pays a further day's wage for work on a holiday."
